%% Sequence — courier updates status, event fans out to notifications (report sequence 3)
%% Based on seq-courier-status.mmd by Thisaru Ramanayaka (Role 6) with Role 4's part; corrected against
%% docs/architecture.md v1.1 §6.2, §6.3 "Who is notified", §10.3
%% Changes: proof photo to MinIO; X-Internal-Token; event published by the outbox relay; all four consumers shown;
%% contacts for customer vs merchant bookings (recipient from parcel-service, not only the customer from auth-service)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Courier
    participant GW as api-gateway :8080
    participant DS as dispatch-service :8084
    participant S3 as MinIO delivery-proofs
    box parcel-service :8083
    participant PS as ParcelService<br/>+ ParcelStateMachine
    participant PDB as parcel_db
    participant Relay as OutboxRelay
    participant TS as TrackingService (SSE)
    end
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ parcel.events
    participant NS as notification-service :8086
    participant AUTH as auth-service :8081
    participant MS as merchant-service :8085
    participant OUT as Mailpit / mock SMS / merchant webhook

    Courier->>GW: POST /api/v1/courier/deliveries/{id}/status<br/>Bearer JWT · multipart {status, note, failureReason?, photo?}
    GW->>GW: verify JWT (JWKS)
    GW->>DS: forward
    DS->>DS: @PreAuthorize COURIER · load assignment
    alt assignment belongs to another courier
        DS-->>Courier: 403 ProblemDetail (via GW)
    end
    opt photo attached
        DS->>S3: PUT object delivery-proofs/{parcelId}/{uuid}.jpg
        DS->>DS: save delivery_proofs row (object key)
    end
    DS->>PS: PATCH /internal/parcels/{parcelId}/status · X-Internal-Token<br/>{status, note, failureReason, proofReference, changedBy, COURIER}
    PS->>PDB: SELECT … FOR UPDATE
    alt transition not allowed
        PS-->>DS: 409 Conflict
        DS-->>Courier: 409 ProblemDetail (via GW)
    else FAILED without reason
        PS-->>DS: 400
        DS-->>Courier: 400 ProblemDetail (via GW)
    else allowed
        Note over PS,PDB: one transaction
        PS->>PDB: UPDATE parcels.status + INSERT parcel_status_history<br/>+ INSERT outbox_events (PENDING)
        PS-->>DS: 200 ParcelResponse
        DS-->>GW: 200
        GW-->>Courier: 200 status updated
    end

    Note over Relay,MQ: asynchronous, about 1 s later
    Relay->>MQ: publish ParcelStatusChanged v1 (parcel.status.out_for_delivery), IDs only
    Relay->>PDB: mark SENT after confirm

    par notification.q
        MQ-)NS: event
        NS->>NS: skip if eventId already processed
        alt customer booking (merchantId null)
            NS->>AUTH: GET /internal/users/{customerId}/contact · X-Internal-Token
            NS->>OUT: email to the customer
        else merchant booking
            NS->>PS: GET /internal/parcels/{id}/contacts · X-Internal-Token
            NS->>OUT: email to the recipient
        end
        opt status is OUT_FOR_DELIVERY, DELIVERED or FAILED
            NS->>PS: GET /internal/parcels/{id}/contacts (recipient phone)
            NS->>OUT: SMS to the recipient
        end
    and webhook.q
        MQ-)NS: event
        opt merchantId set
            NS->>MS: GET /internal/merchants/{merchantId}/webhook
            NS->>OUT: HMAC-signed POST, retry 10 s / 1 m / 5 m, then parking
        end
    and dispatch.q
        MQ-)DS: event
        DS->>DS: update daily_stats counters
    and tracking.q
        MQ-)TS: event
        TS-->>TS: push STATUS_CHANGE to open tracking pages (SSE)
    end
